<misterromdescription>
    <name>Peggle (Trackball, v1.0)</name>
    <setname>pegglet</setname>
    <rbf>Gm0rk_ITech8</rbf>
    <mameversion>0289</mameversion>
    <mratimestamp>20261004</mratimestamp>
    <year>1991</year>
    <manufacturer>Strata / Incredible Technologies</manufacturer>
    <category>Puzzle / Pachinko</category>
    <players>1</players>
    <joystick>dial</joystick>
    <rotation>vertical (cw)</rotation>
    <num_buttons>1</num_buttons>
    <buttons names="Start,Coin,Service" default="Start,R,L"/>

    <romstruct>
Board select (ioctl index 1): 0B = itech8 6809 board (3), 64 KB program
(bit 3); second byte 8B = MAME's lo memory map (bit 0), 2 page large
display at 8 MHz (bits 2-1 = 1), YM3812 sound board with a PIA (bits 4-3
= 1), vertical, turned clockwise (bit 7, MAME ROT90); third byte 07 =
Peggle's inputs (dial on blitter register 13).
Download stream (ioctl index 0), 1,146,880 bytes:
000000 - 007FFF   32K  sound program                  -> block RAM
008000 - 017FFF   64K  main program                   -> SDRAM bank 0
018000 - 057FFF  256K  OKI samples region (128K used) -> SDRAM bank 2
058000 - 117FFF  768K  graphics ROM region (384K used)-> SDRAM bank 1
    </romstruct>

    <rom index="1">
        <part>0B 8B 07</part>
    </rom>

    <rom index="0" zip="pegglet.zip|peggle.zip" md5="40030537c2ebe6d93c7c6e6a48b16c3d">
        <!-- sound program (sound CPU $8000-$FFFF) -->
        <part name="sound.u27" crc="b99beb70"/>
        <!-- main program (64 KB: banks at $4000, last 32 KB at $8000) -->
        <part name="trakball.u5" crc="d2694868"/>
        <!-- OKI M6295 samples -->
        <part name="srom0" crc="001846ea"/>
        <part repeat="0x20000">00</part>
        <!-- graphics ROMs -->
        <part name="grom0.bin" crc="5c02348d"/>
        <part name="grom1.bin" crc="85a7a3a2"/>
        <part name="grom2.bin" crc="bfe11f18"/>
        <part repeat="0x60000">00</part>
    </rom>

    <!-- 8 KB battery-backed RAM (CPU $2000-$3FFF) -->
    <nvram index="4" size="8192"/>
</misterromdescription>
